  "body": "@past The triage meeting seems to be very useful for the coordination of efforts and it was a valuable insight into the WHATWG's workflow, thank you for the invite!\r\n\r\nI think it would be helpful for newcomers to have a short summary of the technicalities of how they can participate in the meetings. I myself had to guess and ask around. Although the answers turned out to be fairly straightforward, I had no way to know that beforehand.\r\n\r\nI would write that intro if you agree. I'm wondering what you'd like to include and where it should be published: on the wiki for ex.?\r\n",
